# Illogical Impulse — Control Center design-system kit (issue #14).
#
# The shared, themed component library every pane composes so the whole app is
# visually consistent and keyboard-accessible by construction. All components read
# the Colors singleton (from the control root module, imported ".."), so they
# re-theme live when the wallpaper changes. Nothing here imports upstream's
# quickshell/ii tree. Adding a component = one file + one line below.
Icon 1.0 Icon.qml
Card 1.0 Card.qml
Section 1.0 Section.qml
Badge 1.0 Badge.qml
Spinner 1.0 Spinner.qml
PillButton 1.0 PillButton.qml
